## Non-negotiables

- Adapter pattern strictly — no raw `httpx` responses escape the client boundary
- All public functions typed — `mypy --strict` must pass
- Async all the way — no `requests` or blocking calls
- Never `git add -A`, never `--no-verify`, Conventional Commits

